# Atomic specification documents

## Rule

Ideas, requirements and specifications MUST be expressed in small independently identifiable `.iasi` documents, each addressing one coherent concept. External sources and specifications have a many-to-many relationship. Source provenance SHOULD be retained in metadata or content.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
